<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-VIISNURK 7 MONTHS PROFIT 7.1MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-VIISNURK 7 MONTHS PROFIT 7.1MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First seven months of 1997</p>
<p>					(million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				    7.1 vs  6.8</p>
<p> Turnover				     92.1 vs 79.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Viisnurk compared the first seven months of 1997 with</p>
<p>the first six months of 1997. Viisnurk, a cross-country ski and</p>
<p>furniture manufacturer, is listed on the secondary list of the</p>
<p>Tallinn stock exchange.</p>
<p>Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
